unu/works/21", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/34ae2470/uploads/origins/8c8507f7-8837-4a4f-afac-5cbfa529623c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c2bc8b719c7bcd6256337858bd8b6403", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/34ae2470/uploads/origins/8c8507f7-8837-4a4f-afac-5cbfa529623c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c2bc8b719c7bcd6256337858bd8b6403, https://si.imgix.net/34ae2470/uploads/origins/8c8507f7-8837-4a4f-afac-5cbfa529623c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f92142a21abeefc53b5b0ece6f1cdf71 2x, https://si.imgix.net/34ae2470/uploads/origins/8c8507f7-8837-4a4f-afac-5cbfa529623c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ba464eb85a12b0cc939d4048a5782966 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは！\nあなたの絵はとてもかわいくて、ぜひ依頼したいです。\nこの野球の服を着た私のキャラクターを描いていただけませんか？\nポーズや表情はお任せしたいです。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1_gyn0GkfqrvmXBQXd_dMMn54HQcZZ0qq/view?usp=drive_link", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@pote_tanunu/works/20", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/822bb001/uploads/origins/43b5df38-ddab-483c-aba5-d10c864364dd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2e3b6378814ffa27ca3b71ca17ed60c9", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/822bb001/uploads/origins/43b5df38-ddab-483c-aba5-d10c864364dd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2e3b6378814ffa27ca3b71ca17ed60c9, https://si.imgix.net/822bb001/uploads/origins/43b5df38-ddab-483c-aba5-d10c864364dd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a1985fce836fcac28da117b63ee7a19c 2x, https://si.imgix.net/822bb001/uploads/origins/43b5df38-ddab-483c-aba5-d10c864364dd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b72e01931ed7801048e30764bd12ab17 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "まちもち様、はじめまして！ まちもち